 "adapter_status": "needs_runtime",
 "reason": "Nostr is not an HTTP API: NIP-01 clients talk to relays over WebSocket with ['EVENT', <event>] / ['REQ', <subscription_id>, <filters>] frames, and every event id is the sha256 of the serialized event signed with 'Schnorr signatures ... on the curve secp256k1' (https://github.com/nostr-protocol/nips/blob/master/01.md, re-read 2026-09-25). Remaining gap: a WebSocket relay transport and BIP-340 Schnorr secp256k1 event signing (the runtime signs with HMAC/hash/RSA/JWT (HS256/RS256/PS256)/SigV4/OAuth1 over HTTPS only)."
